{"sourceUrl":"https://law.bnu.edu.cn/xwzx/xygg/zszp/zs/b649686025ff45aa9354ebc4bd37250e.htm","status":"full","attemptedAt":"2026-11-15T17:20:03.759357+00:00","httpStatus":200,"fetchedUrl":"https://law.bnu.edu.cn/xwzx/xygg/zszp/zs/b649686025ff45aa9354ebc4bd37250e.htm","html":"<div>\n<p><span></span></p>\n<p><span>申请人须于如下学院规定的截止时间前登录我校推免申请系统</span><span>（</span><span>https://yzh.bnu.edu.cn/www/tm/xs/login</span><span>）</span><span>详细填写个人信息，上传规定的材料，下载并填写相关表格。</span></p>\n<p><span>本科直博生系统报名和上传电子版材料的截止时间为</span><span>9</span><span>月</span><span>8</span><span>日</span><span>中午</span><span>12:</span><span>00</span><span>。</span></p>\n<p><span>学术学位硕士研究生</span><span>系统报名和上传电子版材料的截止时间为</span><span>9</span><span>月</span><span>10</span><span>日</span><span>上午</span><span>1</span><span>0</span><span>:00</span><span>。</span></p>\n<p><span>申请条件、</span><span>上传申请材料、学费及奖助政策</span><span>及其他相关要求、相关信息详见北京师范大学研究生招生网（</span><span>https://yz.bnu.edu.cn/</span><span>）发布的《北京师范大学</span><span>202</span><span>6</span><span>年接收校内外推荐免试硕士</span><span>/</span><span>博士研究生办法》</span><span>以及推免申请系统中的“院系公告”栏</span><span>。</span></p>\n<p><span>无需寄送纸质版材料，</span><span>纸质版</span><span>材料在复试时提交学院审核备案。</span></p>\n<p><span>咨询电话：江老师，</span><span>010-58802948</span><span>。</span></p>\n<p><span> </span></p>\n<div><br/>\n</div>\n</div>","textSha256":"fd4297fb166eff2af372ec2890873435b02f9792474c309518573b89f09a0a64","textLength":341,"sourceSha256":"72edc54101ab3f30deab804d919c3381567807a920a177721f1332fd42a235d9","selector":".listconrc-newszw","attachments":[],"pdfs":[],"unavailableMedia":[],"id":"syp-025562e81b710f47f02b","title":"2025年北京师范大学法学院关于2026年接收校内外推荐免试学术学位硕士/博士研究生的通知","capturedAt":"2026-11-15T17:20:03.759357+00:00"}
